{"text":"I don't know about other planets, but I'm sure we can add this in as well. But the point being that growth over time in many African countries has actually declined. In fact, Paul Collier, who I think we'll be hearing from a little bit later, talks about Africa shearing off from the rest of the world. So the rest of the world is going in one direction, Africa is going in a different direction. But also look at the poverty statistics. In 1970, 10% of Africans lived on less than a dollar a day. Today, over 70% of Africans live on less than a dollar a day. Something is wrong. I do not want to sit around and wait for it to be 90% of Africans living on less than a dollar a day. The notion that throwing in an additional $50 billion to Africa is somehow miraculously going to move the needle is completely ridiculous.","words":[{"text":"I","start":0.0,"end":0.68},{"text":"don't","start":0.68,"end":0.78},{"text":"know","start":0.78,"end":0.86},{"text":"about","start":0.86,"end":1.0},{"text":"other","start":1.0,"end":1.18},{"text":"planets","start":1.18,"end":1.52,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":1.74,"end":1.8},{"text":"I'm","start":1.8,"end":1.94},{"text":"sure","start":1.94,"end":2.06},{"text":"we","start":2.06,"end":2.16},{"text":"can","start":2.16,"end":2.24},{"text":"add","start":2.24,"end":2.42},{"text":"this","start":2.42,"end":2.6},{"text":"in","start":2.6,"end":2.76},{"text":"as","start":2.76,"end":2.88},{"text":"well","start":2.88,"end":3.14,"punct":"."},{"text":"But","start":3.98,"end":4.02},{"text":"the","start":4.02,"end":4.18},{"text":"point","start":4.18,"end":4.6},{"text":"being","start":4.6,"end":5.32},{"text":"that","start":5.32,"end":6.34},{"text":"growth","start":6.34,"end":7.12},{"text":"over","start":7.12,"end":7.86},{"text":"time","start":7.86,"end":8.32},{"text":"in","start":8.32,"end":9.02},{"text":"many","start":9.02,"end":9.26},{"text":"African","start":9.26,"end":9.54},{"text":"countries","start":9.54,"end":9.88},{"text":"has","start":9.